  "reason": "The strongest evidence so far is that RNA-only multiprofile with avgpool and PCA substantially outperforms single-profile PCA and multiprofile transformer aggregation. The key remaining uncertainty within this promising setting is whether a learned RNA encoder can improve over PCA. config_005 changes only the RNA encoder from PCA to SCVI while keeping multiprofile and avgpool fixed, so it isolates the effect of RNA representation. This is the best next experiment because it exploits the current best design, avoids introducing image or fusion confounds, and will clarify whether RNA encoder choice is an important factor before testing more complex multimodal configurations."
}

